From 1a8a62ab0c52f3a63127a6be6e85c8adb00af35e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dragonflylee <dragonflylee@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 29 Aug 2025 17:40:46 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] avformat: add SFTP protocol via libssh2

Add an sftp:// protocol implementation backed by libssh2, as an
alternative to the existing libssh backend. Reading, writing, seeking
and directory listing are supported, together with password and
private key authentication and the timeout/truncate options.

The protocol is enabled with --enable-libssh2 and selects tcp_protocol,
as the connection is set up through the tcp protocol.

Also export the AVIO entry points from the Windows DLL through the new
av_export_avio helper.
---
